This project borrows its design from ReMe (https://github.com/agentscope-ai/ReMe),
Copyright 2024-2026 Alibaba Group, Apache-2.0.

What was taken, precisely:

  * The memory model: a local Markdown workspace, `daily/` refined into `digest/`,
    with the workspace itself as the single source of truth.
  * The lifecycle vocabulary: auto memory, dream/consolidation, daily and digest.
  * The retrieval shape: BM25 over the workspace plus bounded wikilink expansion,
    returned as line-ranged evidence rather than prose.
  * The rule that retrieved memory is evidence, not instructions.

No source code from ReMe is included. The implementation is independent: it runs
inside the DeepSeek Harness Host process and has no Python dependency.

DeepSeek Harness (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) is MIT licensed.
Two small helpers in `src/plugin.js` — `createUserMessage` and `defineTool` — are
reproduced from `@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm` and `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools` respectively,
so that the plugin needs no runtime import of Harness packages. They are marked as
such in the source and are used under the Harness license. No other Harness source
code is redistributed here.
